{"id": "Ddjfv-WP9yo", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"CLAUDE\" to get these plugins and 10x your Claude Code setup.\n\nIf you're new to Claude Code, you need to install these 5 free plugins to instantly 10x your setup.\n\nFirst is Claude Mem.\n\nIt gives your Claude memory across every session.\n\nIt remembers your project and files without you ever having to re-explain a thing.\n\nSecond is find-skills.\n\nYou just tell it what you're building.\n\nIt searches its whole library of 100k skills, finds the best ones, and installs them for you.\n\nThird is anydoc.\n\nIt turns your PowerPoint, Word, and Excel sheets into clean markdown files.\n\nSo your AI can read them instantly while consuming way fewer tokens.\n\nThe fourth is Claude Code Setup.\n\nIt's an official Anthropic plugin that scans your entire codebase.\n\nIt recommends the best hooks, skills, sub agents, and even MCP servers that fit your project.\n\nAnd it removes all the unnecessary fluff.\n\nAnd finally there's Agent Skills.\n\nIt's a pack of 24 skills that let you vibe code like a real senior engineer.\n\nBuilt by the former AI engineering director at Google.\n\nIt covers your entire dev cycle and activates the right skill at each specific stage of coding, all on its own.\n\n#claudecode #claudeplugins #claudemem #agentskills #anydoc", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1790005046, "like_count": 3009, "comment_count": 3596, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-962576772828989a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.926, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQM4FcRHlnZQ1UUT8vNg4J2V1RvURmjteiuKT_IiLUEUITrbI1po29WB1f4Q8IjGyeJcLdsvPcXHu-8XCbPHRlbciELmKlaN1Ens3Uo.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=AdoqrBxCAnM7QWcKdMxwJ1qHjq4WOtJc5sL9CQurnY2dYjipZ97fRKzzSrrOcq6x